    "type": "synonym_match",
    "question": "Which word is closest in meaning to 'difference' (The\u00a0state\u00a0or\u00a0relation\u00a0of\u00a0being\u00a0different,\u00a0dissimilarity)?",
    "options": [
     "deviation",
     "investments",
     "deviate",
     "dexterous"
    ],
    "answer": "deviation",
    "explanation": "'deviation' shares the meaning of 'difference': The\u00a0state\u00a0or\u00a0relation\u00a0of\u00a0being\u00a0different,\u00a0dissimilarity."
